## .NET Libraries in .NET 11 Preview 1 - Release Notes

[](#net-libraries-in-net-11-preview-1---release-notes)

.NET 11 Preview 1 includes new .NET Libraries features & enhancements:

*   [Zstandard Compression Support](#zstandard-compression-support)
